@startuml Payment Component Database Schema (Normalized)
!theme vibrant

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam roundcorner 8

title Payment Component Database Schema - Normalized Master-Detail Pattern\n(Component Tables with FK References - NO Core Table Extensions)

' OXID Core Tables (READ-ONLY - NOT EXTENDED)
